Rustmix Wave audiobooks

Copy audiobooks into /Audiobooks on the SD card:
  - one .mp3 file is one audiobook;
  - one folder of .mp3 files is one audiobook, its tracks played in name
    order with numbers counted as numbers (2 before 10).

MP3 (MPEG-1 or 2, layer III), mono or stereo, up to 48 kHz. The position of
every audiobook is saved in /System/AUDIOPOS.TXT.
